n- ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_CODE <-> SUBJECT_SUMMARY.TERM_CODE\n- TIP_DETAIL.SUBJECT_ID <-> TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED.SUBJECT_ID\n- SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY.SUBJECT_ID <-> TIP_DETAIL.SUBJECT_ID\n\n## Question\nFor subjects offered in the academic year 2024 with a total of 12 units, show the subject code, subject number, subject title, department name, term description, and the rank of each subject within its department ordered by subject code. Additionally, for each subject's department, include the average, range, and variance of the total units for subjects that have at least one enrolled student and have required course materials. Display the results ordered by department name and subject code. Do not return any rounded answers."
